<title>TANZANIA: SOCCER-TANZANIA AND ZAMBIA DRAW 2-2 IN COSAFA CASTLE CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TANZANIA AND ZAMBIA DRAW 2-2 IN COSAFA CASTLE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ARUSHA 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Cosafa Castle Cup</p>
<p>match played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Tanzania 2 Zambia 2 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Tanzania - Edibilly Lunyamila (56th minute), Hussein Marsha</p>
<p>(75th penalty)</p>
<p>Zambia - Masauso Tembo (71st), Alex Namazaba (83rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 22000</p>
<p>    Standings   P  W  D  L  F  A PTS  </p>
<p>    Zambia	2  1  1  0  6  2  4</p>
<p>    Mozambique  2  1  1  0  5  2  4</p>
<p>    Namibia     2  1  1  0  4  1  4</p>
<p>    Tanzania    3  0  2  1  2  5  2</p>
<p>    Malawi	3  0  1  2  3  10 1</p>
<p>Next match: Mozambique v Namibia, Maputo, July 20</p>
